size 100 10
start
keys v j T
frame open-tasks
file todo.txt open-file
keys g g v j T
frame reopened
file todo.txt reopened-file
keys j j j v j T
frame plain-done-refused
file todo.txt refused-file
keys <Esc> v j T
frame all-wontdo-reopened
file todo.txt all-wontdo-file
